    text:"The California State Senate passed SB 947, the \"No Robo Bosses Act of 2026,\" 29-9. The bill would bar employers from using an automated decision-making system as the sole basis to fire or discipline a worker, require human review of any such action, and ban ADS tools that predict a worker's future behavior from their personal data. It now moves to the Assembly.",
