    text:"Skild AI released S1, a robotic foundation model that executes tasks up to 10 minutes long from a single human video demonstration with no fine-tuning, achieving 66% success on unseen tasks. The model is trained to infer demonstrator intent and functional correspondences across viewpoints and embodiments; unseen tasks that ran 3-5 minutes achieved 60%+ success, with even longer tasks showing measurable performance. Skild raised $1.4 billion at a $14+ billion valuation, reflecting investor confidence in the foundation-model approach to embodied AI.",
