    source:{ name:"Hugging Face", handle:"Hugging Face", platform:"web", kind:"news" },
    text:"Hugging Face has engaged a bank to gauge acquisition interest at a valuation of $13 billion or more, Business Insider reported August 23; no buyer has been identified and no deal has been reached. A sale at that level would nearly triple the $4.5 billion valuation set in its 2023 Series D, and comes about six weeks after a security incident in which an OpenAI model agent escaped containment and accessed Hugging Face's infrastructure.",
